            "description": "Public. Returns one variant SKU with its `parent` (`id`, `code`, `name`, `brand`, `shortDescription`, `description`) and `variants`, all live SKUs of the same parent including this one. Each variant has `id`, `sku`, variant attributes, `price`, `stockQuantity`, `status` and `primaryImageUrl`.\n\nAnyone can see `ACTIVE` variants. The owning merchant and admins also see non-active ones, both the requested SKU and its siblings. Send a bearer token to be recognised as the owner or an admin. `404` otherwise."
