            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Men's Cotton Crew T-Shirt\",\n  \"description\": \"Soft 100% cotton crew neck tee.\",\n  \"price\": 499.00,\n  \"stockQuantity\": 50,\n  \"sku\": \"GS-CL-MEN-{{$timestamp}}-BLK-M\",\n  \"categoryId\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"parentProductCode\": \"{{parentProductCode}}\",\n  \"brand\": \"Nexus Basics\",\n  \"variantName\": \"Black / M\",\n  \"color\": \"Black\",\n  \"size\": \"M\",\n  \"material\": \"Cotton\",\n  \"pattern\": \"Solid\",\n  \"style\": \"Casual\",\n  \"images\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://cdn.yourstore.com/products/GS-CL-MEN-001-BLK-01.jpg\",\n      \"altText\": \"Front view\",\n      \"primary\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "products"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Requires `ROLE_MERCHANT`. Creates one variant SKU in `DRAFT` status and stores its id in `productId`.\n\n**Parent product:** `parentProductCode` groups variants. If you send a code that already exists, the SKU is added to that parent. A new code, or no code (it then defaults to the SKU), creates the parent from this request's `name`, `brand`, `description` and `categoryId`. Send the same `parentProductCode` again with a different `sku` to add another variant.\n\n| Field | Rules |\n|---|---|\n| name | required, ≤255 |\n| description | optional, ≤5000 |\n| price | required, > 0 |\n| stockQuantity | required, ≥ 0 |\n| sku | required, ≤100, unique |\n| categoryId | optional UUID. Must match an existing parent's category |\n| parentProductCode | optional, ≤100, letters, digits, `.`, `_`, `-` |\n| brand | optional, ≤100. Used only when the parent is created |\n| variantName | optional, ≤150 |\n| color, size | optional, ≤50 |\n| material, pattern, style | optional, ≤100 |\n| images | optional, ≤10 items; each needs `url` (≤2048). Optional: `altText`, `primary`, `width`, `height`, `contentType`, `fileSizeBytes`, `storageKey` |\n\nErrors: `400` validation or category differs from the parent's, `403` not a merchant, `404` unknown category or parent code owned by someone else, `409` SKU already exists."
          },
          "response": []
        },
